		(uuid "c8f7bf46-75cf-5cc6-b2fa-864de6916901")
	)
	(text "WARNING: Reference design. Test first with a current-limited supply and protection. Not for unattended use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c220bf68-68c4-520d-957a-4bacc5583db6")
	)
	(text "Design only, not fabricated, not bench-tested. Variant B: the Li-ion pack MUST have its own protection (over-discharge, short circuit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68a65731-a174-5dc5-a4b8-ccadafe8bc08")
	)
	(text "KEY VALUES (README has the derivations and sources)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "525b1887-5b98-5bdf-87e9-2b885e96b18f")
	)
	(text "A: Vout = 1.0 V x (1 + 100k/24.9k) = 5.02 V (4.86-5.17 V worst case). L1 10 uH: ripple <= 1.46 A, peak <= 3.23 A at 2.5 A (HS limit >= 3.85 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13c8372e-9394-5901-82a8-5fd59a478216")
	)
	(text "A: EN divider 100k/18.2k starts at 7.8-8.2 V. Q1 |VGS| = VIN up to ~11.4 V, then D3 clamps (VGS max 20 V). F1 3 A covers 1.63 A at 9 V with 70 C derating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e04dae2-2a9d-5f48-9238-5442afe26ad6")
	)
	(text "A: SMAJ24A clamps at 38.9 V at full pulse, above the LMR33630 VIN abs max of 38 V. Input 9-24 V only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7f8596fb-ce6f-5f13-86dd-428f85400a8d")
	)
	(text "B: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 73.2k/10k) = 4.99 V. Battery 1.96 A at 3.0 V / 1 A out (eta 0.85 assumed). MT3608 limit 4 A typ, no minimum given."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80770a75-efd4-5f53-8702-f8a268cdfaae")
	)
	(text "B: EN_B low stops switching but does NOT disconnect: VBAT - VF still reaches 5V_B. MT3608 UVLO is ~2 V: pack protection required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "353df580-8732-5d18-8787-6b03428759c1")
	)
	(text "B: SMAJ8.5A chosen over SMAJ5.0A for leakage (20 uA vs 800 uA max at VR). F2 4 A; a Li-ion short can exceed its 50 A interrupting rating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d1c3d0af-6956-5cce-a6be-58d2b9b775ca")
	)
